op: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;这是英国和法国面临的几个共同挑战之一。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;两国首都都面临着&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/jHC7kd20x1zzw33VY1Jx1j5iwWTCGQVCDSCXtiQIK0XcRDGMgYDAdxq_4q7Dnl0T_fbSxJIh3jHSOmM_WxNU-k_SnI7HnDM5e9XDAowR3dJ7HKl36yR7QUqezGZUY_SEtK2gp44inOIAJrhLnqXwCzFVHy8ulTBTsYhjG45thSBG1BxWxhOFm02CF0IVTWJ3WJC8hY4WnjOV6GzukSMsDI01jyC8wFQ2ONvqHHktzQTpEYvNyGBc71d5-w0Aa3Br35zvukrwvymIwkZFTXz1xkO0GB-GrsfcBwrU14yNHmDYOA08yWTH9bHOzwD6ytZxLDsfEUp_7T-QL9PYkU8rebCkpd4uygD3BTylpsh4O0TJ0d_s9Qbhdgmx2XprqM6e4ubr67GOeFyQvrYt-NC5Am4-S0L-ie1GSF_gMi-rqGHlb434odheu4wy5cEqzpvTtHM00ii4Z5SCyQsyTqQ7YMhEJWZ1YN9UykPmKuUrmDSTMld-injJVSC1BnuD0prcgpeaswAa3pRuVhI-WMV7fTZBFxZYKbl483XvRBuTur5m/fwGyeoi3RCB5ohNMns_fGpBYPfVbKdZe/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="法国议员敦促快速制定预算以避免代价高昂的僵局"&gt;令人不安的财政压力，&lt;/a&gt;这使它们成为&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/iY4yrS5GZFn8Y0wUwy0jjd_TkBNiwaU26qAJeWX16DylDqlarnEubEiTEcr5b7EieApMxL3mYr5PWbxM6r4X0LWgXYfdvEN1U_gjvbo0n2YsubtBHHKxRkZmCicPBPPEoQjtpvwFzKOxzw0WGNaQH65eGi3TPNNP58nm3eQz-pLoAg5jILBggXgyHlev4NnwNEy5BjjGVgx1tZnmlTYHd_DZ4d-WT9YaEBCiRp5QZDDFS3Rq7STTnRUsFVf_J6sggDdMw9x0aF8-VN7ORP5hTukNAksdWHwSptx4lE54hFemd5T8mY_6PDG-2Q2vg-16Zmv93srCtMYuu2qjEHZ7LCPCNKSGXlr_ujSdQ9XWJZ6Ef3pTlO28w1mRgYAF2a_rrf2qeUeSTr72AyNOwWzMFC0_FtN1rK9cHY7nMwv5ci6KqaKz251E90eRaNMLyG0mmE0maTBu9rhYB2m0J3qLhDAggFcMgT3fhqejSM42LJej4mH_oAxiumqIE2H-fkVlpBQJl5VPwxCQmEURziEQqOsjBp4zDA3lmOmxG1dZzWyQ/QcZrGdpEF0QV6aLIgJGMTg-idwoY3XJx/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="英国借贷成本飙升使工党的财政空间减半"&gt;全球债券市场紧张&lt;/a&gt;的中心。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;长期以来，处理&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/-Q7ZS3Fpwpei7kKcBC9GAbBE9CvIj_I1fKX9Fg03E_Rd6DSvJAHciHWACUZ9fSZ_o7HnkkUXaPWb2zJ8u8WCojYkyL_CU8Q2ezDVx8-NUwgao7UuWKZmCy4mCvYo0PbZZXuiRPa99honJKCfq0bnag0b29bdl-a1XbndUA5bDrhfVrIAZjYff9bWuW